<title>USA: AEP, PSCo venture hold 92 pct of Yorkshire.</title>
<headline>AEP, PSCo venture hold 92 pct of Yorkshire.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Electric Power Co Inc said Yorkshire Holdings Plc had received 146,861,995 Yorkshire Electricity Group Plc shares as of Tuesday.</p>
<p>The shares represent about 92.3 percent of Yorkshire Electricity's issued shares, which are being sought by Yorkshire Holdings, a joint venture of American Electric and Public Service Co of Colorado.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
</text>
